# dsh-builtin-browser 0.5.8 — close a task's browser session when its turn ends.
# Apply from the package root (…/profiles/desktop/node_modules/dsh-builtin-browser):
#   git apply -p1 --whitespace=nowarn turn-cleanup.patch
# or run apply.ps1 next to this file, which copies patched/ over the package and
# backs up what it replaces.

